This MIT license covers the MyST template configuration files in this
repository:

- `template.tex`         (Jinja/jtex template)
- `template.yml`         (template manifest)
- `myst.yml`             (example project config)
- `example/*.md`         (example markdown sources)
- `example/*.bib`        (example bibliography)
- `README.md`, `PATCHES.md`, and other documentation

The Elsevier CAS LaTeX classes and style files are NOT covered by this MIT
license. They are licensed under the LaTeX Project Public License version
1.3c (LPPL-1.3c). See `LICENSE-LATEX` for the full text. The files covered
by LPPL-1.3c are:

- `cas-sc.cls`
- `cas-dc.cls`
- `cas-common.sty`
- `cas-model2-names.bst`
- `thumbnails/cas-*.jpeg`
- `original/*` (verbatim copy of the upstream Elsevier bundle)

The documentation prose in this repository (README.md, PATCHES.md, example
narrative text) is additionally available under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0). See `LICENSE-CONTENT`.
